OL,3,AFarmers' fury as race for #233m funding
OL,4,Acompared to 'scramble for Oasis
OL,5,Atickets'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThousands of farmers missed out on
OL,8,Fvital government funding after online
OL,9,Fapplications for a #233m green scheme
OL,10,Ffor the whole of England closed down in
OL,11,Funder six hours.
OL,13,FFarming and environmental groups
OL,14,Fcondemned the race to secure the
OL,15,Fsustainable farming incentive (SFI)
OL,16,Ffunding, with some comparing it to a
OL,17,F"frantic" online scramble to secure
OL,18,FGlastonbury or Oasis gig tickets.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
