OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFarmers' fury as race for #233m funding
OL,4,Acompared to 'scramble for Oasis
OL,5,Atickets'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe post-Brexit scheme, which replaced
OL,8,FEU subsidies with payments for farmers
OL,9,Fto look after nature and provide
OL,10,F"public goods", opened at 10:00 BST on
OL,11,FTuesday but had run out of budget by
OL,12,F15:48 BST.
OL,14,FThe government said farmers had
OL,15,Fresponded "in force" to the scheme and
OL,16,Fthere would be further funding
OL,17,Fopportunities for 2027.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
